<title>UK: Mauritius tenders to buy cargo white sugar-traders.</title>
<headline>Mauritius tenders to buy cargo white sugar-traders.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mauritius has entered the market with a tender to buy one cargo of white sugar, London traders said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>The cargo would be for shipment between March to June, they added. No further details were immediately available.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 8064</p>
</text>
